      "content": "but that feels so fake though. like, even those \"moments\" are just chemical reactions in a brain that's eventually gonna rot. it feels more like we're just performing a script we didn't write. if the end result is always just dust and nothingness, why is there all this pressure to keep pushing through the pain? it just feels illogical.",
